<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Becksham in conditional offer for Minvest.</title>
<headline>Becksham in conditional offer for Minvest.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barbados-based Becksham Corp said on Thursday it was making a conditional offer to shareholders in Messina Investments Ltd to acquire their holdings for 500 cents a share cash.</p>
<p>The offer is conditional on acceptance by holders of at least 90 percent of the shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
